<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Shanghai on 酷玛阁 | KumaTea's Blog</title><link>https://blog.kmtea.eu/tags/shanghai/</link><description>Recent content in Shanghai on 酷玛阁 | KumaTea's Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 30 Mar 2026 22:54:35 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.kmtea.eu/tags/shanghai/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>国庆游记</title><link>https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/</link><pubDate>Sun, 28 Dec 2025 21:30:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/cover.webp" alt="Featured image of post 国庆游记" /&gt;&lt;h1 id="国庆游记"&gt;国庆游记&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;2025年国庆成都及上海旅游记录&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="准备"&gt;准备&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="小红书" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="135px" data-flex-grow="56" height="2133" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/ss_xhs.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/ss_xhs_hu_75a757c8cd7bd515.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/ss_xhs.webp 1200w" width="1200"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;9月30号晚上还没任何计划&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;10月1号晚上蹲到便宜机票直接决定出发&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="行程" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="112px" data-flex-grow="46" height="2560" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/ss_ticket.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/ss_ticket_hu_1a73dfa6ca9abbbd.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/ss_ticket.webp 1200w" width="1200"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="10月3日"&gt;10月3日&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;成功赶早班地铁去机场起飞&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="云海" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="180px" data-flex-grow="75" height="4096" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_080942.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_080942_hu_4d4aa8a7a8a39323.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_080942_hu_7cab91246e735be7.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_080942_hu_f500625cad9b3c3d.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_080942.webp 3072w" width="3072"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;到成都已经是晚上了，到酒店办完入住去春熙路&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="熊猫屁股" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3072" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_192647.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_192647_hu_4d4fd590131a52ce.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_192647_hu_664095e7fdaca93b.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_192647_hu_5185f49170efec41.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_192647.webp 4096w" width="4096"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="积木熊猫" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3072" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_213202.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_213202_hu_69599beda830276d.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_213202_hu_ee01a4ccf6141410.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_213202_hu_fc42e09bdae81da8.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_213202.webp 4096w" width="4096"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="嘟嘟哒嘟嘟哒" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="180px" data-flex-grow="75" height="4096" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_220226.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_220226_hu_6957242c4121b030.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_220226_hu_659be5d4215f2e0.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_220226_hu_8ecd105462ab0c45.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_220226.webp 3072w" width="3072"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="10月4日"&gt;10月4日&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;早上先去宽窄巷子，人特别多，没太多特别的&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="宽窄巷子" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3072" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251004_111429.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251004_111429_hu_2a66cf955547ddfe.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251004_111429_hu_456f2c330f699f81.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251004_111429_hu_ca2a7cc90857c357.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251004_111429.webp 4096w" width="4096"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;下午换完酒店后比较晚了，没赶上去熊猫基地，下次再来&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;在杜甫草堂和武侯祠之间选了后者&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="武侯祠" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3072" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251004_165721.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251004_165721_hu_9ca752a55cc545e2.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251004_165721_hu_39f3f3cc6b305c47.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251004_165721_hu_877419f3d920f92d.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251004_165721.webp 4096w" width="4096"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;晚上去了锦里，感觉还是没什么特别的，就没拍照&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="10月5日"&gt;10月5日&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;今天报了一日旅游团去青城山和都江堰&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="青城山" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="426px" data-flex-grow="177" height="2303" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251005_084411.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251005_084411_hu_cac94f9d3777ab0d.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251005_084411_hu_35f39b9231b42335.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251005_084411_hu_18e59e86030b3cc1.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251005_084411.webp 4096w" width="4096"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="都江堰" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3060" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251005_152226.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251005_152226_hu_d2737e90e09bf36b.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251005_152226_hu_fde3c10c81582f4b.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251005_152226_hu_745f14594a5512ea.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251005_152226.webp 4080w" width="4080"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="自拍熊猫" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3072" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251005_192954.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251005_192954_hu_d509189e2e657949.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251005_192954_hu_6a70966e5c612a15.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251005_192954_hu_da77783e0118ab18.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251005_192954.webp 4096w" width="4096"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="10月6日"&gt;10月6日&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;又到上海，找了在上海中转一天的机票&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;到达已经是下午了，随便逛逛&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="四行仓库" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3072" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_164132.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_164132_hu_2c1dfab811624bff.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_164132_hu_6d628181a2e8d75.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_164132_hu_cc3ddd75fe823566.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_164132.webp 4096w" width="4096"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;到四行仓库已经闭馆了，只拍了个外景&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="地道" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="426px" data-flex-grow="177" height="2303" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_174158.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_174158_hu_523e07803a8be99f.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_174158_hu_2afac4511ec9bcb6.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_174158_hu_872b164f5b2356a3.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_174158.webp 4096w" width="4096"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;广东　路人　行地道&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;地道地地道道地道地地道&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="静安寺" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3060" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_190646.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_190646_hu_5ba2125eda73dfb7.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_190646_hu_62449b56686e6d6f.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_190646_hu_88abc5290b4a1081.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_190646.webp 4080w" width="4080"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="冲塔" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="180px" data-flex-grow="75" height="4096" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_220655.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_220655_hu_5ee909df8bb10b1c.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_220655_hu_6a2b12b0c5b81ff9.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_220655_hu_7f9a93e7efcc83cd.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_220655.webp 3072w" width="3072"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="10月7日"&gt;10月7日&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;订了一家地铁旁边的酒店&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="video-wrapper"&gt;&#10; &lt;video&#10; controls&#10; src="vid/VID_20251007_081238.mp4"&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &gt;&#10; &lt;p&gt;&#10; Your browser doesn't support HTML5 video. Here is a&#10; &lt;a href="vid/VID_20251007_081238.mp4"&gt;link to the video&lt;/a&gt; instead.&#10; &lt;/p&gt;&#10; &lt;/video&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="video-caption"&gt;地铁&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;p&gt;返程，飞机在中午&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;早上没地方去，原计划去上海动物园，后来觉得时间太紧&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;搜了下周边有个商业街叫蟠龙天地，非古镇纯仿古，就过去转了半个多小时&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="180px" data-flex-grow="75" height="4096" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251007_091825.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251007_091825_hu_51fd95b2a23715d3.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251007_091825_hu_ef14445b03247425.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251007_091825_hu_30efa3dd849c088f.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251007_091825.webp 3072w" width="3072"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="video-wrapper"&gt;&#10; &lt;video&#10; controls&#10; src="vid/VID_20251007_105548.mp4"&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &gt;&#10; &lt;p&gt;&#10; Your browser doesn't support HTML5 video. Here is a&#10; &lt;a href="vid/VID_20251007_105548.mp4"&gt;link to the video&lt;/a&gt; instead.&#10; &lt;/p&gt;&#10; &lt;/video&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="video-caption"&gt;起飞&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;总结：依然是独自旅行，国庆节有出去一下至少感觉不是虚度&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;消费统计：&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;table&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;thead&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;th&gt;项目&lt;/th&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;th&gt;金额&lt;/th&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;th&gt;占比&lt;/th&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;/tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/thead&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;tbody&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;交通&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;32.70&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;1.22%&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;/tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;报团&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;410.00&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;15.34%&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;/tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;购物&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;123.00&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;4.60%&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;/tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;路费&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;916.50&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;34.30%&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;/tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;酒店&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;381.50&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;14.28%&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;/tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;门票&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;50.00&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;1.87%&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;/tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;饮食&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;141.25&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;5.29%&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;/tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;总计&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;2672.10&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;/tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/tbody&gt;&#10;&lt;/table&gt;&#10;</description></item><item><title>六月游记（二）</title><link>https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/</link><pubDate>Fri, 04 Oct 2024 16:30:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-153538.webp" alt="Featured image of post 六月游记（二）" /&gt;&lt;h1 id="六月游记二"&gt;六月游记（二）&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;2024年6月上海旅游记录&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="6月4日"&gt;6月4日&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;坐下午的火车从嘉兴到上海，已经是晚上了&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;先到青旅放下行李，就去欣赏南京路的夜景&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240604-215557.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240604-215557_hu_1152b48a0a50f7e2.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240604-215557_hu_77c5a57e00f68d87.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240604-215557_hu_c4145960e7255988.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240604-215557.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;已经打烊的水果店&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240604-221911.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240604-221911_hu_842328629fe104ac.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240604-221911_hu_599fd041d81c8a07.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240604-221911_hu_60c4903e56ab3301.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240604-221911.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;走过马路对面就是外滩了&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3600" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240604-223306.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240604-223306_hu_ba36bd530cdb48b5.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240604-223306_hu_8f446eac6ad30685.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240604-223306_hu_e7275f80a72f1946.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240604-223306.webp 4800w" width="4800"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;外滩夜景！&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="426px" data-flex-grow="177" height="2250" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240604-223645.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240604-223645_hu_4bb0a06024a91b0e.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240604-223645_hu_3c22cf614f3d26ea.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240604-223645_hu_93492c5f4a7b35a1.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240604-223645.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="6月5日"&gt;6月5日&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;早上有点小雨，来博物馆逛了一圈，但没什么有趣的&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-111903.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-111903_hu_82a88c54d15f9387.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-111903_hu_e32bd613129ddab8.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-111903_hu_32e72ec5dab04a27.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-111903.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;雨中的南京路&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="240px" data-flex-grow="100" height="3000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-122119.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-122119_hu_e443e27c39e25682.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-122119_hu_69c5613706a4386a.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-122119_hu_8fa17df44a15c46b.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-122119.webp 3000w" width="3000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;下午到浦东看陆家嘴三件套了&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="180px" data-flex-grow="75" height="4000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-140549.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-140549_hu_d8dc86b1039888b6.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-140549_hu_5612fab59bd15f6f.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-140549_hu_650b2ed0313d46d7.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-140549.webp 3000w" width="3000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;以及东方明珠&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="135px" data-flex-grow="56" height="4000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-140843.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-140843_hu_aa214765706a84de.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-140843_hu_3f816cce5c000e16.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-140843.webp 2250w" width="2250"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;关门的水果店&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="180px" data-flex-grow="75" height="4000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-143345.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-143345_hu_73578584997978eb.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-143345_hu_4d5f1f1f43ebdb32.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-143345_hu_ad224a06104a75cd.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-143345.webp 3000w" width="3000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;从下面向上看三件套&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-145643.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-145643_hu_a90ddcee5db8dc00.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-145643_hu_1d97250faee7c8f5.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-145643_hu_873f7e3059897023.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-145643.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;去坐轮渡过江了，2元&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="426px" data-flex-grow="177" height="2250" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-152224.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-152224_hu_5f78dc70fc1cf0f3.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-152224_hu_119262eb23eb8bc4.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-152224_hu_601239a2ffaac16c.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-152224.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;白天的黄浦江江景&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="426px" data-flex-grow="177" height="2250" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-153538.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-153538_hu_982f991d07c414aa.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-153538_hu_ef43d058cef7f9cf.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-153538_hu_85cc569416920167.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-153538.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;之后去了豫园逛了一圈，就一个小园子&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-160200.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-160200_hu_ac5c82af008f5011.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-160200_hu_4ab786d9abd7e4b3.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-160200_hu_38cbb4e1bb217faa.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-160200.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;到了晚上，看夜景，因为骑车上人行道10秒喜提警察拦下&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;报了身份证号，估计是看我臭外地的，只是口头教育没罚款&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-205218.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-205218_hu_8fd9d4368c3a3afd.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-205218_hu_8e864dedd52ab7da.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-205218_hu_f022bb94c72708e9.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240605-205218.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="6月6日"&gt;6月6日&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;早上去了城市规划馆&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;强烈推荐！比博物馆有趣多了！&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240606-114328.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240606-114328_hu_4d6f1f3c854c41fe.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240606-114328_hu_40f5712445dc9734.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240606-114328_hu_1e61b3a67cf122f6.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240606-114328.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;下午去了中华艺术宫&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240606-131303.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240606-131303_hu_116425c8f17365d5.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240606-131303_hu_2d269f38d14f2660.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240606-131303_hu_6cf14d7c7f0242c5.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240606-131303.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;路过一大纪念馆的地铁站，不用去馆里都能速览了&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;下午又跟图批面了，逛了下南京路的二次元店&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240606-205519.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240606-205519_hu_15ccbec1cac66bc8.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240606-205519_hu_ec48e2b3f6b3b2ec.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240606-205519_hu_5689585d2c140f2c.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240606-205519.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;晚上经过一条街，有点 Just Monika 的恐怖感&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240606-214048.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240606-214048_hu_e9a682a5c03466cf.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240606-214048_hu_b58499573964afb4.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240606-214048_hu_efef3712c5bbba10.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240606-214048.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;这天晚上出来其实是速通了浦发银行的城市行走活动&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;运气超好抽中了两份一等奖&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="426px" data-flex-grow="177" height="2250" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240606-220040.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240606-220040_hu_dc09e4deb0f3a28f.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240606-220040_hu_3b57c27f539b37d.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240606-220040_hu_e1b6fa4da4cd6bdb.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240606-220040.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="6月7日"&gt;6月7日&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;今天去苏州一日游&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240607-074724.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240607-074724_hu_a3f64803ee8502c7.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240607-074724_hu_37605829b7e6ff0b.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240607-074724_hu_e38bb196a6108bde.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240607-074724.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;第一站是狮子林&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;就是……很多石头&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240607-091834.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240607-091834_hu_c8f1a27af60c7916.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240607-091834_hu_94f18c85b147268a.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240607-091834_hu_854e8d8ff3923896.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240607-091834.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="426px" data-flex-grow="177" height="2250" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240607-094332.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240607-094332_hu_35625f3908cee1c.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240607-094332_hu_53d794b79d68728.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240607-094332_hu_af052183e975fd3.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240607-094332.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="426px" data-flex-grow="177" height="2250" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240607-103744.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240607-103744_hu_fbe983237d6857bc.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240607-103744_hu_c610f369d61bd817.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240607-103744_hu_18a4408924ddaef8.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240607-103744.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;下午去虎丘景区&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="180px" data-flex-grow="75" height="4000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240607-144437.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240607-144437_hu_cbdfed0c779af86.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240607-144437_hu_38568cab52675463.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240607-144437_hu_e9addc27a81ea3ba.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240607-144437.webp 3000w" width="3000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;最后一站是平江路&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="180px" data-flex-grow="75" height="4000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240607-161329.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240607-161329_hu_b24a0147151a7fb8.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240607-161329_hu_30a83e5fd6f93c34.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240607-161329_hu_b70331aac4c06f5e.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240607-161329.webp 3000w" width="3000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;今天上海虹桥站入闸时间是开车前2分钟，&#10;苏州站入闸时间是开车前1分钟，&#10;在此感谢愿意通融的工作人员&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="6月8日"&gt;6月8日&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;这次旅游的最后一天了&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;早上先去了上海图书馆&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;上海户籍才能办借阅证，游客只能办阅览证，也办了&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240608-093234.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240608-093234_hu_fc6cd9182f548a15.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240608-093234_hu_62e2188cb18e658e.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240608-093234_hu_4e92a25e07cdd0c6.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240608-093234.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;长条形的莫名其妙一堆人来打卡的楼&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="240px" data-flex-grow="100" height="3000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240608-102321.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240608-102321_hu_b871144de99c279a.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240608-102321_hu_add25aeaae808701.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240608-102321_hu_aeddc6d954cbe47.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240608-102321.webp 3000w" width="3000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;上海交大，没提前预约，不能进&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240608-103237.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240608-103237_hu_85efca6f92d7944d.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240608-103237_hu_5ba8fc12388c6a92.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240608-103237_hu_7123ef7727d38c90.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240608-103237.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;复旦大学，医学院校区，没预约，刷身份证就能进&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240608-110856.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240608-110856_hu_c5b5876e8e2fa593.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240608-110856_hu_6f571572e3df2b8d.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240608-110856_hu_836db9b4a733d8a1.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240629-jun-travel-2/img/20240608-110856.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;路过一大会址&lt;/p&gt;&